          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Flüchtling is built on flüchten \"to flee\", from Flucht \"flight\", Old High German fluht (EtymDB), with the ending -ling for a person."
            }
          ]
        },
